@startuml 003-discovery-seq-detail
title View Room Detail & Availability Calendar

actor "Guest/Customer" as User
participant "DiscoveryController" as Ctrl
participant "DiscoveryService" as Svc
database "Database" as DB

== View Room Detail ==
User -> Ctrl: GET /api/v1/rooms/{id}
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: getRoomDetail(id)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: findRoomById(id)
activate DB
DB --> Svc: Room Entity (or null)
deactivate DB

alt Room Not Found or Property Inactive
    Svc --> Ctrl: throw ResourceNotFoundException
    Ctrl --> User: 404 Not Found
else Room Found
    Svc -> DB: load Gallery & Amenities
    activate DB
    DB --> Svc: RoomImages, Amenities
    deactivate DB
    
    Svc -> Svc: map to RoomDetail DTO
    Svc --> Ctrl: RoomDetail
    Ctrl --> User: 200 OK (Room Details)
end
deactivate Svc
deactivate Ctrl

== View Calendar Availability ==
User -> Ctrl: GET /api/v1/rooms/{id}/availability?month=6&year=2026
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: getRoomAvailability(id, year, month)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: findOverlappingBookings(roomId, startOfMonth, endOfMonth)
note right of Svc: Filters blocking statuses:\nPENDING_DEPOSIT, CONFIRMED,\nRESERVED, OCCUPIED
activate DB
DB --> Svc: List<Booking>
deactivate DB

Svc -> Svc: calculate bookedDates[] from Bookings
Svc --> Ctrl: RoomAvailability (bookedDates)

Ctrl --> User: 200 OK (Availability Data)
deactivate Svc
deactivate Ctrl
@enduml
